                                                "sense_id": "2e69a60c-c905-38d7-8ef3-95d3de636ca0",
                                                "text": "2004, Ben Westhoff, \"Making Traks,\" Riverfront Times, St. Louis MO, 7 Apr,\nThe Starz seem most comfortable when they're in the studio, where they can work incommunicado."
